    "title": "Water main shut off for repairs in Nottingham - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Chris Montcalmo ,\n10 hours ago NOTTINGHAM, MD—Crews have shut off a water main in the Nottingham area in order to make repairs.\nThe Department of Public Works reports that an 8-inch water main has been turned off for repair work in the 4100 block of India Avenue (21236).\nThe shut off affects 20 services and 1 hydrant, according to Councilman David Marks.\nThere has been no word on when service is expected to be restored. Motorists should use caution in the area.\n3",
